Package: cyclo-provider-pooler
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         cyclo-agent (>= 0.2.1)
Description: quota-aware account pool component for Cyclo providers
 This package installs the immutable Docker build context for Cyclo's provider
 pooler component. The component groups account-qualified models and chooses a
 member that has not reported a typed pre-stream exhaustion error.
 .
 The package does not create a provider declaration, start a container, or
 store credentials. Operators add an explicit pooler declaration to host.conf.
